## 3. Navigation / Menu Configuration

**No `.sitemap` or `Menu.xml`** file exists. Navigation is handled by **`his/Controls/MainMenu.ascx`** (with code-behind `MainMenu.ascx.cs`). It uses:

- **URL parameter `?pt=X`** to highlight active menu items (switch on `Request["pt"]`)
- **Permission-based visibility** via `WebGlobal.HasPermission("PermissionKey")` 
- Menu categories: "THONG TIN", "HOC TAP", "GIANG DAY", "QUAN LY", with sub-menus under collapsible sections

The SubjectMarkDetail menu entry (line 140):

```140:140:g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL-12\07-ha-tinh\his\Controls\MainMenu.ascx
