```

Permission check for SubjectMarkDetail (line 65):

```65:65:g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL-12\07-ha-tinh\his\Controls\MainMenu.ascx.cs
bool bolSubjectMarkDetail = WebGlobal.HasPermission("frmWebSubjectMarkDetail_View");
```

**URL Rewriting** is in `his/urlrewrite.config` -- uses regex rewriting for friendly URLs like `~/dang-nhap.html`.

