## 4. UClass_ForPermission.ascx and UYearSemester2.ascx

### UClass_ForPermission.ascx
**Path:** `g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL-12\07-ha-tinh\his\Controls\Sims\UClass_ForPermission.ascx`

Provides 3 cascading dropdowns: Khoa (Science) > Khoa (Course) > Lop hoc (Class), with permission filtering.

**Key public properties/methods:**
```csharp
public string PermissionID        // set permission key for filtering
public string ManagerTeacherID    // set teacher username to load their classes
public string ScienceID           // get selected science ID
public string ScienceName         // get selected science name
public string CourseID            // get selected course ID
public string CourseName          // get selected course name
public string ClassID             // get selected class ID (null if not selected)
public string ClassName           // get selected class name
public int ClassType              // get class type from DataTable
public int RegulationID           // get regulation ID of selected class
public void LoadData()            // load data from DB using stored proc SIM_Class_SearchForPermission
public event EventHandler SelectedChanged  // fires when class changes
```

**Usage pattern in SubjectMarkDetail.ascx:**
```xml
<uc2:UClass_ForPermission ID="uClass" runat="server"/>
```
With code-behind:
```csharp
uClass.PermissionID = PERMISSION_VIEW;
uClass.ManagerTeacherID = User.UserName; // to load teacher-assigned classes
