### Key Architectural Summary

| Component | Location | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Master Page** | `BDS.Master` | Main layout with sidebar menu, AjaxControlToolkit |
| **Menu** | `Controls/MainMenu.ascx` | Permission-based sidebar navigation |
| **User Controls** | `Controls/[Module]/` | All business logic in .ascx controls |
| **Page Wrappers** | `Pages/[Module]/` | Thin .aspx wrappers around controls |
| **Base Classes** | `Utility/` (compiled) | ControlBase, PageBase, WebGlobal, MsgBox |
| **DAL** | `SimsObject.SIM_Branch` (external DLL) | Stored procedure calls via `GetDataTable()` |
| **BLL** | `SimsService.*` (external DLL) | Business logic like `TotalRow()`, `ToLearningLevel()` |
| **Excel Export** | `Libs.CExcel` (external DLL) | Template-based .xls export |
| **Config** | `Web.config` | Connection strings `DefaultConnectionString2`, `BConnectionString` |
| **Session** | `DCore.SessionUser` | User authentication via `Session[DCore.Globals.USER]` |
| **Permissions** | `WebGlobal.HasPermission()` | String-based permission keys |
| **URL Rewriting** | `urlrewrite.config` | Friendly URL mapping |
